{"title":"2011 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Brian writes down four integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/9/1192c5f717cf0b4bc6e1c268253347f0eab47237.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w &gt; x &gt; y &gt; z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"117\" height=\"15\" /> whose sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/4/5b45828f292e161290be6ee62bc4c9df081ee1e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. The pairwise positive differences of these numbers are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/d/94d3b72c72ca9697a5a9da1ad2d9d6560ecb16e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1, 3, 4, 5, 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"77\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. What is the sum of the possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/e/9ee4b825a2e36ae093ed7be5e4851ef453b34914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/1/241e238193551b7f8ea31f83ba6c0bcc6ea05bbd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 16 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 31 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 48 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 62 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 93$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Assume that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/6/8a6afe0dded0c28ff1780d49397609f5cd7f0658.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y-z=a, x-y=b, w-x=c.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"247\" height=\"16\" /> \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/4/f5438bdb7b43b6e6fe0956b8095fda5125bd886b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w-z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"47\" height=\"14\" /> results in the greatest pairwise difference, and thus it is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. \nThis means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/9/9f979a53cc1e8c6a604a3a8d89bfb9230bb08965.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c=9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"102\" height=\"14\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/b/a5b29b358e825defa3e11b7d903d43ec31e5909a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" /> must be in the set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/d/88d6f4c62fdd2fbe3ea4ba38c778e46b5a8f4f46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${1,3,4,5,6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"77\" height=\"16\" />.\nThe only way for 3 numbers in the set to add up to 9 is if they are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/8/97827a34a0f6699ae2b5fd23665cc8eecd056286.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1,3,5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" />. \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add2609af1bb7632cc22b68fd49fdd94de06b327.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/b/c9bbeb7caa1770d1d3cb842655f27e245b08188f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> then must be the remaining two numbers which are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\nThe ordering of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/d/f3d9e22097e20a1249b5332202b24941a4bf9e1f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b,c)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"57\" height=\"20\" /> must be either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/5/7c5e9a2fa63c6727ceb3a308a09115f807daebbe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3,1,5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"56\" height=\"18\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/6/ee6efa3561362f6c9c07f3ab22be0e085c9758da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(5,1,3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"56\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/6/cd667706af76bb07e92861a56809d76ada134b16.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} z + (z + a) + (z + (a + b)) + (z + (a + b + c)) &amp;= 4z + a + (a + b) + 9\\\\ 4z + a + (a + b) + 9 &amp;= 44\\\\ \\text{if} \\hspace{1cm} a &amp;= 3 \\\\ a + b &amp;= 4\\\\ 4z &amp;= 44 - 9 - 3 - 4\\\\ z &amp;= 7\\\\ w &amp;= 16\\\\ \\end{align*}\" width=\"540\" height=\"163\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/d/5dd02ced6b791b38d32cbd82780e2c884f5beab6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\text{if} \\hspace{1cm} a &amp;= 5\\\\ a + b &amp;= 6\\\\ 4z &amp;= 44 - 9 - 5 - 6\\\\ z &amp;= 6\\\\ w &amp;= 15\\\\ \\end{align*}\" width=\"202\" height=\"112\" />\n</p><p><br />\nThe sum of the two w's is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/7/3f7262a4fa637d893e155331e48e48fee8379ff7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15+16=31$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"100\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/e/f2e33ab9a00e021af49e888212645d4667903c49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the four numbers be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/0/ea047f9947313169d3e4a87bdc8cab3aace44598.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z+a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/9/09955b659ee85e62e223aee466003b403d25ce45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/2/652b5b32db075c68dd6ebac8c2e3920198b6d6b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"14\" />. We know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> because that's the greatest difference. So we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/0/ea047f9947313169d3e4a87bdc8cab3aace44598.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z+a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/9/09955b659ee85e62e223aee466003b403d25ce45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/3/f13f8b923f22ff9cb75fdcd38b194c73ab825c45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z+9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />. The 6 possible differences are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/c/02c60c151331e235dc6d9df7ca403b6f0c9af39b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b-a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/7/1374768311323ac0bb2d4d6e16302c24e6518a24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9-a$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/e/27e0f1e56275087075e87823d1ef395bcda22a98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9-b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" />. We are given that the differences are 1, 3, 4, 5, 6, 9. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/7/1374768311323ac0bb2d4d6e16302c24e6518a24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9-a$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/e/27e0f1e56275087075e87823d1ef395bcda22a98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9-b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" /> add to 9 which means they have to be 4, 5 and 3,6 or vice versa. Which leaves <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. That means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/c/02c60c151331e235dc6d9df7ca403b6f0c9af39b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b-a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" /> has to equal <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. So a and b have to be 3,4, 4,5, or 5,6. For 3,4, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/c/a4c14206a8c93da67234750465b54d5ef93ef5c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z+3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/9/6a9e759d9a82e52b852df783ffa59985fbd314d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z+4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/3/f13f8b923f22ff9cb75fdcd38b194c73ab825c45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z+9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/c/6bc349eb0676f72f592344cb372b4f87922c8689.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4z+16=44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"103\" height=\"15\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/e/bee26d812aa10dbc0b2eaaad64b5eb5d2571971a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4z=28$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"63\" height=\"14\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/a/04a297f4a650b7dd42cc64198204345fbc873164.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z=7$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/3/8533a5c9a95a24b40e13f6e6924d757034f95521.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w=7+9=16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"122\" height=\"15\" />. Now for 4,5, notice that it doesn't work. The differences are 4, 5, 9, 1, 4, 5. We are missing 6 and 3. For 5,6, it's <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/7/747ce3ae9280d25edb333f1820e16a80cc1b8d8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z+5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/f/56f7339caa03025dea24feb4d2f0616db8397d19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z+6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/3/f13f8b923f22ff9cb75fdcd38b194c73ab825c45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z+9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />. Check that the differences work; they do. We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/a/aca1fea6ddd1d6ac0dc06ed0b52980e15dc6eab9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4z+20=44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"103\" height=\"15\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/c/2fc47d6383e7b433c5083b92a80b34520486ac7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4z=24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"63\" height=\"14\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/6/7d627a16a6871c2f4b62f503a1a57b665af3e399.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z=6$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/d/76d17a6528efddaecb97b244b7aaaf78908b148a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w=6+9=15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"122\" height=\"15\" />. Therefore our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2d9cb6ba5751180bff5e89618e34a291534638.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15+16=\\boxed{31}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"114\" height=\"25\" />.\n~MC413551\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B\" title=\"2011 AMC 12B\">2011 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2011 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2011 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2011 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2011 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2011 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2011 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2011 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2011 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2011 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2011 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2011 AMC 12B Pr